# Root-level Vercel ignores — only applies when the project uses the REPO ROOT
# as Root Directory (Root Directory = `backend` uses backend/.vercelignore).
#
# The deployable API is backend/api/** + backend/lib/** + backend/types/** +
# backend/public/. Everything else is dead weight in the upload.
android/
docs/
supabase/
.github/
*.md
LICENSE
